# Ubuntu 24.04 (noble), amd64 and arm64; observed 2026-10-10.
# apt-cache policy: local amd64 and SSH dgx20/dgx21 arm64.
# Firmware is Architecture: all; .10 observed installed on amd64, superseding
# stale .9 candidates in the remote apt indexes. Refresh indexes before install.
# Exact direct dependencies only. APT resolves their dependencies; evidence
# includes the entire dpkg state before/after, including those dependencies.
# Update these reviewed pins when repositories retire a version; never float.
# systemd-ukify is not listed: the baseline derives it from the installed
# systemd version and refuses when that exact version left the archive.
qemu-system-arm=1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18
qemu-system-x86=1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18
